// A book club lends books. Book cards sit in the shelf and member columns, a loan moves a book to the member, and a loan over the limit is refused.
cards Book club loans

box shelf as Shelf [note: Book club]
box aki as Aki [note: Member]
box ben as Ben [note: Member]

item b1 as The Little Prince in shelf [amount: 1 vol.]
item b2 as Botchan in shelf [amount: 1 vol.]
item b3 as Night Train in aki [amount: 1 vol.]

step Borrow
  say Aki borrows The Little Prince from the shelf.
  aki -> b1: Borrow
  item b1 in aki

step Over the limit
  say Aki already has two books, so a third is not lent.
  aki -> b2: Borrow
  refuse b2: Two books at most

step Return and borrow
  say Aki returns Night Train, and Ben borrows Botchan.
  item b3 in shelf
  ben -> b2: Borrow
  item b2 in ben

step Swap books
  say The worn copy of Night Train is removed, and a donated book goes on the shelf.
  delete b3
  item b4 as I Am a Cat in shelf [amount: 1 vol.]
